{
  "slug": "founderfocus",
  "name": "Founderfocus",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Behavioral operating system for solo founders managing parallel workstreams. Enforces execution discipline, captures ideas without session derailment, and ensures seamless session recovery.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `founder-focus` (Enforce execution discipline during active build sessions for solo founders and operators managing parallel workstreams), `idea-vault` (Capture, compress, and triage ideas that arrive during active build sessions), `session-close` (Activate at the end of any build session to verify completion, generate a status entry for Operator, and…), `session-open` (Activate at the start of any build session, work session, or focused work block), `session-recover` (Handle interrupted, incomplete, or unexpectedly ended build sessions)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install founderfocus@claude-community` from `MartelGPT10/founderfocus`.",
